  "apply_examples": {
    "description": "Operations applied in the order given, as the total operation order sorts them, on a board with the columns Backlog, Doing and Done. Operations are abbreviated, and columns, items and bugs are given by a name instead of their ID.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "description": "An item moved to a column that was removed has no column",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemDraftOperation", "id": "X", "title": "Fix the build", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "RemoveColumnOperation", "column": "Doing"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "X", "column": "Doing", "position": "a3"}
        ],
        "items": [{"id": "X", "column": null, "position": "a3"}]
      },
      {
        "description": "A column removed after an item was moved to it: the same result",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemDraftOperation", "id": "X", "title": "Fix the build", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "X", "column": "Doing", "position": "a3"},
          {"op": "RemoveColumnOperation", "column": "Doing"}
        ],
        "items": [{"id": "X", "column": null, "position": "a3"}]
      },
      {
        "description": "A move of an item that was removed does nothing",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemDraftOperation", "id": "X", "title": "Fix the build", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "RemoveItemOperation", "item": "X"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "X", "column": "Done", "position": "a3"}
        ],
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "description": "A bug added twice is held once: the second operation adds no item, and the move that follows it, designating the bug, applies to the item of the first",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemEntityOperation", "id": "X", "namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "AddItemEntityOperation", "id": "Y", "namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P", "column": "Done", "position": "a5"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "P", "column": "Doing", "position": "a6"}
        ],
        "items": [{"id": "X", "column": "Doing", "position": "a6"}]
      },
      {
        "description": "A converted draft is designated by its own ID and by the ID of the bug: a move made on the draft applies after the conversion",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemDraftOperation", "id": "X", "title": "Fix the build", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "ConvertDraftOperation", "item": "X", "namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "X", "column": "Doing", "position": "a3"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "P", "position": "a4"}
        ],
        "items": [{"id": "X", "content": {"namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P"}, "column": "Doing", "position": "a4"}]
      },
      {
        "description": "A bug removed and added again is a new item, which the ID of the bug designates",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemEntityOperation", "id": "X", "namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "RemoveItemOperation", "item": "P"},
          {"op": "AddItemEntityOperation", "id": "Y", "namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P", "column": "Done", "position": "a5"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "P", "position": "a6"}
        ],
        "items": [{"id": "Y", "column": "Done", "position": "a6"}]
      },
      {
        "description": "A move within a column does not undo a move to another column: the last move gives the position, the last one that sets a column gives the column",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemDraftOperation", "id": "X", "title": "Fix the build", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "X", "column": "Done", "position": "a4"},
          {"op": "MoveItemOperation", "item": "X", "position": "a1"}
        ],
        "items": [{"id": "X", "column": "Done", "position": "a1"}]
      },
      {
        "description": "The edit of a draft that was converted does nothing, as does a second conversion",
        "operations": [
          {"op": "AddItemDraftOperation", "id": "X", "title": "Fix the build", "column": "Backlog", "position": "a0"},
          {"op": "ConvertDraftOperation", "item": "X", "namespace": "bugs", "entity": "P"},
